  "body": "Experience the ultimate in seaside single-level living with this stunning new home at Lot 26, 59 Kumukumu Road, Long Bay. Perfectly positioned at the top of Long Bay, this property offers unmatched access to the vibrant new Long Bay Village with its array of cafes, bars, eateries, and shops.\r\n\r\nThis is one of the last opportunities to secure a premium build in Stage 15 West, Long Bay. Designed by one of our reputable 10-Year Master Builders, this home features four spacious bedrooms, two bathrooms, and an open-plan living area ideal for entertaining. Enjoy peace of mind with a comprehensive structural and workmanship guarantee of up to 10 years.\r\n\r\nTake advantage of living in a sought-after area, within walking distance to Long Bay Beach, top-rated schools, and a thriving community atmosphere.\r\n\r\nCall Dean or Jamie today to learn more and make this exceptional property yours.",
